We’re refining the experience iteratively—try our demo and share your insights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version will feature a broader roster of characters, new gameplay modes, and exciting under-development surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575930/extras/154953bde698a498dc4250fe1ec7b480.poster.avif?t=1781662706\" width=200 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575930/extras/154953bde698a498dc4250fe1ec7b480.webm?t=1781662706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The curtain rises—step into the opera!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Add to your wishlist now and prepare to duel on the stage of fate!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to follow the X account @Game_CJRX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>From the dev team: This game is our tribute to the artistry of Chinese opera. We hope you love it.</u></i></p>",
